  "notes": "Stages follow the 3-6-4 structure most schools run in 2026: elementary school (Prep, Elementary 1–2), primary Grades 3–8, high school Grades 9–10 and secondary Grades 11–12. Prep is pre-primary and not listed. The National Education Plan 2020–2029 moves to 1-6-6 (primary Grades 1–6, secondary 7–12), trialled in six provinces with national roll-out from 2027; year names stay Grade 1–12. The Partnership Compact is the Department of Education's own document, hosted by GPE."
